        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehu hakwijila mwitala, hakudya nakunwa; hakwila nindi, Yenu mwani, mwakamutali iwu mumbanda washiŋewa, mwakamujiiki, muloŋa yena himwana kamwanta. ",
          "type": "text",
