              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakufunta nakumuleja. Yena nindi, Dodizu daYehova dahosheliyi kukanwa kakambuŋindi Elija wakuTishebi, deliliyi nindi, Atuwa akamudya Yezebeli mwiseka dakuYezereyeli; ",
